      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Summerlin West’s 2025 plan introduces Kestrel and Grand Park villages, adding new homes, parks, and roads to support growth.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
